DEFINE CLASS frmbase1 AS frmbase OF "clases\controles.vcx" 
 	*< CLASSDATA: Baseclass="form" Timestamp="" Scale="" Uniqueid="" />

	*-- OBJECTDATA items order determines ZOrder / El orden de los items OBJECTDATA determina el ZOrder 
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="Foxcharts1" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
	*< OBJECTDATA: ObjPath="_dash_cobranza1" UniqueID="" Timestamp="" />
